  {
    "hotel_id": "6405135",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-stay-osaka-shinsaibashi/hotel/osaka-jp.html",
    "name": "GRAND HOSTEL LDK OSAKA SHINSAIBASHI",
    "detail": "I slept in the female-only dorm and the beds/cubicles were really wide! It even had a small locker (with key) that also acts like a table top!!! And bonus!! A ventilation fan for each cubicle!!!! This was my first stay in Japan, and I'm really, really impressed. I can't help but compare my subsequent stays at other places with this one. The Stay is really hard to beat. I love (and miss) everything about it. One thing though, the card is needed to be with you at all times, even during shower so that you could get back in. I left it once :( I think it'd be better if the door locks both ways so a card would be needed to go out as well, that way it prevents being forgetful about it (the second hostel I stayed in was like this). Other than that, everything's lovely. :) ",
